'''Woody Park''' (Japanese: '''森林公園''' ''Forest Park'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location located in [[Johto]]. It appeared in ''[[HZ094|The Pokémon Center Lady]]''.

The park is located near [[Mochew City]] and is described as a hiking trail that even beginners can enjoy, a fact attributed to the lack of aggressive [[wild Pokémon]]. The [[Exceed Testing Center]] is also located nearby, and the recent development of the [[Strong Sphere]]s resulted in wild Pokémon being affected by [[Laquium]].

[[Mollie]] occasionally ventures into this place in order to treat injured Pokémon when she is not working at her family's [[Pokémon Center]].
